        "slc_9b09fa8ed448f729b260dec8532d2193af4997fe12287c220daf10478a70d12a"
      ],
      "text": "Document-oriented skills rely on optional extras (invincat-cli[pdf], [office], [all-skills]) and may need system tools such as LibreOffice, Poppler, Tesseract, or Node.js packages."
    },
