      ],
      "text": "The WeCom bot daemon is configured with WECOM_BOT_ID and WECOM_BOT_SECRET environment variables, optionally overrides WECOM_WS_URL (default wss://openws.work.weixin.qq.com), and runs project-scoped remote turns and scheduled-task delivery."
