  "summary": "The package is distributed on PyPI as invincat-cli, requires Python 3.11+, and can also be installed from source via an editable pip install. The product exposes slash commands including /model, /plan, /goal, /memory, /schedule, /mcp, /threads, and /help, plus a wecombot subcommand to start the WeCom daemon. Evidence coverage: 104 of 108 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
